<title>USA: Comstock Partners Chairman Salvigsen dies.</title>
<headline>Comstock Partners Chairman Salvigsen dies.</headline>
<dateline>JERSEY CITY, N.J. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stanley Salvigsen, chairman of the board of Comstock Partners Inc and Comstock Partners Funds Inc, has died, the companies said in a joint statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Salvigsen died August 30, they added.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
